  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Evaluation, and  Learning (MEL) activity - Local Works</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity prioritizes learning, with a dual focus on managing for sustainable results as well as accountability to local people and communities. It supports well-thought-out engagement with local sources, owners, and users of data. The MEL Activity has four components: a) Monitoring at a higher level and across USAID LW activities. b) Evaluating individual activities. c) Collaborating, learning, and adapting. d) Building the capacity of USAID partners to jointly. develop measurements of success with their communities.</narrative>
  </description>
